; The delegated "dev.example.com." zone: a normal A record, a short-TTL
; record to demo real TTL expiry, and a wildcard to demo wildcard synthesis.
$TTL 3600
$ORIGIN dev.example.com.
@                        IN  SOA  ns1.dev.example.com. hostmaster.dev.example.com. (
                                  2026081401
                                  3600
                                  900
                                  604800
                                  3600 )
@                        IN  NS  ns1.dev.example.com.
ns1.dev.example.com.     IN  A   127.0.0.5
api                      IN  A   127.0.0.6
ticker                 2  IN  A   127.0.0.7
*                        IN  A   127.0.0.9
